1
00:00:01,506 --> 00:00:03,996
(Episode 3)

2
00:01:01,195 --> 00:01:03,524
Hey! Stop right there.

3
00:01:03,524 --> 00:01:05,779
Give me my money back.

4
00:01:05,779 --> 00:01:07,277
Leave the money.

5
00:01:07,277 --> 00:01:10,669
If you run away now,
don't bother about coming back.

6
00:01:10,669 --> 00:01:12,431
You are a bad son.

7
00:01:19,158 --> 00:01:22,354
Why are you bringing water
when it's raining?

8
00:01:22,354 --> 00:01:23,858
Well, Mo...

9
00:01:25,287 --> 00:01:27,426
The water will be shut off today.

10
00:01:29,382 --> 00:01:31,282
Give it to me. I will do it.

11
00:01:32,214 --> 00:01:34,137
Do you want me to do the cleaning? Mo...

12
00:01:34,599 --> 00:01:36,335
Stop bothering me.

13
00:01:36,335 --> 00:01:38,369
I will ask you when I need it.

14
00:01:43,727 --> 00:01:47,602
If you can't call me Mom,
just call me Ma'am.

15
00:01:59,616 --> 00:02:02,202
Soon Im.

16
00:02:02,202 --> 00:02:03,819
- Yes?
- There is a call for you.

17
00:02:03,819 --> 00:02:06,502
Why did you give her my phone number?

18
00:02:10,502 --> 00:02:11,607
Hello.

19
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:24,075
Let's go in.

20
00:02:26,623 --> 00:02:28,457
Where is your mom?

21
00:02:28,457 --> 00:02:30,080
She went for an errand.

22
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:33,144
Is that so? Can you make soup?

23
00:02:33,144 --> 00:02:35,243
Yes, I can. Please wait for a moment.

24
00:02:37,151 --> 00:02:38,378
Give her back to you?

25
00:02:39,744 --> 00:02:41,074
I am sorry.

26
00:02:42,367 --> 00:02:43,946
Please give Eun Seo back to me.

27
00:02:44,983 --> 00:02:46,082
Go back, please.

28
00:02:47,607 --> 00:02:49,299
Please let me meet Eun Seo.

29
00:02:51,207 --> 00:02:53,638
Please let me meet my Eun Seo.

30
00:02:53,638 --> 00:02:55,564
Do I owe you something?

31
00:02:55,564 --> 00:02:57,462
Is she the debt I owe you?

32
00:02:57,462 --> 00:03:00,184
Then give me my Sin Ae back.

33
00:03:02,693 --> 00:03:07,762
I cannot send Sin Ae to your home.

34
00:03:09,311 --> 00:03:11,143
Why is that?

35
00:03:11,143 --> 00:03:12,402
She...

36
00:03:14,153 --> 00:03:16,122
does not want to come back here ever.

37
00:03:17,936 --> 00:03:20,940
Did she say that?

38
00:03:22,992 --> 00:03:25,026
We are leaving for the U.S. soon.

39
00:03:25,841 --> 00:03:29,036
I cannot leave Eun Seo behind.

40
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:37,154
Is Sin Ae leaving with you?

41
00:03:39,439 --> 00:03:40,771
I am sorry.

42
00:03:42,136 --> 00:03:44,931
I know we are being selfish, but,

43
00:03:44,931 --> 00:03:48,287
can't we take care of...

44
00:03:48,287 --> 00:03:50,738
both Sin Ae and Eun Seo?

45
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:55,273
I do not mean to keep her forever
as my daughter.

46
00:03:55,273 --> 00:03:57,951
Only until she graduates
from university...

47
00:03:57,951 --> 00:04:01,304
or only while we are in the U.S...

48
00:04:01,304 --> 00:04:04,755
I will take good care of them. Please?

49
00:04:08,688 --> 00:04:10,467
Do you think Eun Seo...

50
00:04:16,057 --> 00:04:17,651
can even attend university here?

51
00:04:18,831 --> 00:04:21,210
She might end up
working at your restaurant.

52
00:04:22,663 --> 00:04:24,258
Please do not be greedy.

53
00:04:25,785 --> 00:04:27,003
Greedy?

54
00:04:27,961 --> 00:04:31,635
What I mean is, we can offer them more.

55
00:04:33,775 --> 00:04:36,121
Look.

56
00:04:36,121 --> 00:04:38,545
You are right.

57
00:04:38,545 --> 00:04:40,044
I am being greedy.

58
00:04:40,672 --> 00:04:43,232
That is why I make Eun Seo
work at the restaurant.

59
00:04:43,232 --> 00:04:45,532
And I use her for my sake.

60
00:04:46,248 --> 00:04:49,440
You have no idea how much work
is needed at the restaurant.

61
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:51,555
It gets much busier in winter.

62
00:04:51,555 --> 00:04:53,826
So how can I give her to you?

63
00:04:53,826 --> 00:04:56,985
The daughter I have raised until now
does not even want to come back here.

64
00:04:56,985 --> 00:04:59,437
What more can I say?

65
00:05:00,666 --> 00:05:01,837
Ms. Soon Im.

66
00:05:22,108 --> 00:05:23,406
How much is this?

67
00:05:25,098 --> 00:05:26,428
For now,

68
00:05:29,386 --> 00:05:33,017
we would like to express our gratitude
for raising Sin Ae so far.

69
00:05:35,449 --> 00:05:36,624
Eun Seo.

70
00:05:39,171 --> 00:05:42,492
If you give me Eun Seo,
we will do our best...

71
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,555
Can you give me everything you have?

72
00:05:47,191 --> 00:05:48,191
What?

73
00:05:48,567 --> 00:05:49,714
Can you?

74
00:05:50,911 --> 00:05:54,664
Is this the value of Sin Ae and Eun Seo?

75
00:05:54,664 --> 00:05:57,420
Are you trying to haggle
with our daughters for money?

76
00:05:57,968 --> 00:05:58,968
Ms. Soon Im.

77
00:06:01,724 --> 00:06:04,099
Do all rich people do it this way?

78
00:06:04,099 --> 00:06:08,084
How dare you offer me this dirty money?

79
00:06:18,581 --> 00:06:20,937
Come here.

80
00:06:23,254 --> 00:06:24,272
Okay.

81
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:29,238
This soup has no meat, just bones.

82
00:06:29,238 --> 00:06:31,772
Right, there is nothing but bones.

83
00:06:31,772 --> 00:06:32,803
There are only bones.

84
00:06:32,803 --> 00:06:36,421
So, you must sing a song for us.

85
00:06:36,421 --> 00:06:37,573
Can you sing?

86
00:06:37,573 --> 00:06:40,675
I bet she can sing just like her mother.

87
00:06:40,675 --> 00:06:41,748
Okay, go ahead.

88
00:06:41,748 --> 00:06:45,269
I am in a good mood, so...

89
00:06:45,269 --> 00:06:46,999
Sing for us.

90
00:06:46,999 --> 00:06:49,483
Are you not going to sing?

91
00:06:49,483 --> 00:06:50,754
All right.

92
00:06:50,754 --> 00:06:53,425
Then, fill up my glass. Come here.

93
00:06:53,425 --> 00:06:55,278
Yes, fill up my glass.

94
00:06:55,278 --> 00:06:57,195
Fill up my glass now.

95
00:06:57,195 --> 00:06:58,530
Come on.

96
00:06:58,530 --> 00:07:01,522
I said, fill up my glass.

97
00:07:03,481 --> 00:07:06,435
Come on, fill up my glass.

98
00:07:07,884 --> 00:07:09,228
- Soon Im.
- Come with me.

99
00:07:09,777 --> 00:07:10,977
Soon Im, what are you doing?

100
00:07:10,977 --> 00:07:12,662
Do not kill the mood.

101
00:07:25,723 --> 00:07:26,733
Mom.

102
00:07:28,451 --> 00:07:29,451
Mom.

103
00:07:30,906 --> 00:07:31,932
Mom.

104
00:07:33,162 --> 00:07:35,910
Eun Seo.

105
00:07:37,388 --> 00:07:38,388
Eun Seo.

106
00:07:42,764 --> 00:07:43,901
Eun Seo.

107
00:07:43,901 --> 00:07:45,384
Mom.

108
00:07:46,540 --> 00:07:47,946
Eun Seo.

109
00:08:02,284 --> 00:08:03,468
Eun Seo.

110
00:08:14,785 --> 00:08:16,085
She called you "Mom."

111
00:08:19,345 --> 00:08:21,029
If she doesn't feel it from her heart,

112
00:08:22,971 --> 00:08:25,109
she doesn't call anyone "Mom."

113
00:08:27,569 --> 00:08:29,649
She has never called me...

114
00:08:31,589 --> 00:08:33,905
Mom, not even once.

115
00:08:38,925 --> 00:08:40,598
You were right about things.

116
00:08:42,670 --> 00:08:44,673
If she stays with me,

117
00:08:45,934 --> 00:08:48,128
she would have a tough life...

118
00:08:49,069 --> 00:08:50,792
working at the restaurant.

119
00:08:53,070 --> 00:08:55,113
She won't be able to do what she wants.

120
00:08:56,189 --> 00:08:58,176
She won't be able to study
as much as she wants.

121
00:08:59,582 --> 00:09:01,199
She won't have a decent life.

122
00:09:03,358 --> 00:09:04,592
All right.

123
00:09:06,310 --> 00:09:08,609
I can live as if I never had a child.

124
00:09:10,173 --> 00:09:12,681
Honestly, raising a child
is a burden for me.

125
00:09:16,054 --> 00:09:17,264
Yes,

126
00:09:18,975 --> 00:09:21,567
I don't deserve to be a mom.

127
00:09:27,334 --> 00:09:28,576
Take her with you.

128
00:09:31,454 --> 00:09:33,655
Your family is leaving for the U.S.

129
00:09:35,078 --> 00:09:36,311
You should go with them.

130
00:09:39,575 --> 00:09:40,951
Take her with you.

131
00:09:43,405 --> 00:09:44,623
Thank you.

132
00:09:45,973 --> 00:09:47,952
Thank you so much.

133
00:09:53,894 --> 00:09:55,048
Eun Seo.

134
00:09:56,917 --> 00:10:00,910
Eun Seo, I...

135
00:10:02,493 --> 00:10:04,272
Let's go home, Eun Seo.

136
00:10:05,916 --> 00:10:08,846
I can't go with you.

137
00:10:11,391 --> 00:10:14,424
I'm not your daughter.

138
00:10:15,717 --> 00:10:21,287
You have Sin Ae and Jun Seo.

139
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:24,538
No, Eun Seo.

140
00:10:26,064 --> 00:10:27,925
I am all right.

141
00:10:27,925 --> 00:10:29,246
I am fine, Mom.

142
00:10:30,437 --> 00:10:33,801
So, don't worry about me.

143
00:10:34,460 --> 00:10:35,460
Eun Seo.

144
00:10:36,243 --> 00:10:37,787
Eun Seo. No.

145
00:10:37,787 --> 00:10:39,365
Eun Seo.

146
00:10:41,727 --> 00:10:44,144
Mom.

147
00:10:45,251 --> 00:10:46,589
Mom.

148
00:10:47,611 --> 00:10:48,903
Mom.

149
00:10:52,349 --> 00:10:55,298
Mom, I am sorry.

150
00:10:55,298 --> 00:10:56,946
I am sorry, mom.

151
00:10:56,946 --> 00:11:01,053
Don't send me away.

152
00:11:06,156 --> 00:11:07,445
Eun Seo.

153
00:11:33,940 --> 00:11:35,420
Let me have a bite.

154
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:37,588
Eun Seo, come join us here.

155
00:11:37,588 --> 00:11:40,066
We are fine. We will have lunch here.

156
00:11:40,066 --> 00:11:41,543
Eun Seo, let's eat.

157
00:11:43,758 --> 00:11:46,491
Eun Seo, what is this?

158
00:11:49,528 --> 00:11:52,467
That is head meat, pig's head.

159
00:12:00,281 --> 00:12:01,910
Thanks for the meal.

160
00:12:08,745 --> 00:12:10,213
It is tasty.

161
00:12:10,213 --> 00:12:11,472
I will have more.

162
00:12:47,462 --> 00:12:50,231
Eun Seo, slow it down.
I'll stop following you.

163
00:13:09,992 --> 00:13:14,605
Do you know this road leads to the beach?

164
00:13:15,290 --> 00:13:16,397
Really?

165
00:13:18,785 --> 00:13:21,487
How many days are left
until your birthday?

166
00:13:21,487 --> 00:13:24,233
Would you like to go to the beach
on your birthday?

167
00:13:25,407 --> 00:13:27,528
What I regret the most is that...

168
00:13:27,528 --> 00:13:32,375
I left behind the watch
you had given me...

169
00:13:32,375 --> 00:13:34,264
for my birthday last year, at home.

170
00:13:35,927 --> 00:13:39,065
That was the first birthday gift
you had ever given me.

171
00:13:42,327 --> 00:13:43,634
Was it the first time?

172
00:13:44,118 --> 00:13:46,122
Yes, it was.

173
00:13:47,431 --> 00:13:48,824
How stingy you are.

174
00:13:48,824 --> 00:13:52,034
You had a total of 14 opportunities.

175
00:13:52,034 --> 00:13:53,034
You are a fool.

176
00:13:54,466 --> 00:13:56,509
Did you just realize that?

177
00:13:58,305 --> 00:13:59,653
You are a real fool.

178
00:14:10,267 --> 00:14:14,245
What do you want to be
if you were to be born again?

179
00:14:15,658 --> 00:14:16,658
What about you?

180
00:14:18,153 --> 00:14:19,332
I want to be...

181
00:14:21,450 --> 00:14:22,729
I will be a tree.

182
00:14:24,427 --> 00:14:25,644
A tree?

183
00:14:25,644 --> 00:14:27,062
Yes, a tree.

184
00:14:27,835 --> 00:14:29,763
Once it has taken root,

185
00:14:29,763 --> 00:14:32,205
it can't move anywhere else.
I want to be such a tree.

186
00:14:33,345 --> 00:14:38,501
Then I won't have to part with anyone
ever again.

187
00:14:42,753 --> 00:14:45,925
So, we will say goodbye for now.

188
00:14:46,370 --> 00:14:47,460
Eun Seo.

189
00:14:47,460 --> 00:14:49,076
I will say goodbye to you now.

190
00:14:49,076 --> 00:14:52,791
I will leave Mom, Dad, and you.

191
00:14:54,052 --> 00:14:55,756
I told that to Mom already.

192
00:14:55,756 --> 00:14:57,703
I told her I am not her daughter.

193
00:14:59,132 --> 00:15:00,199
Eun Seo.

194
00:15:01,804 --> 00:15:04,358
When you all leave me, I will be sad.

195
00:15:05,099 --> 00:15:08,547
When you all leave for the U.S.,
I will be so sad.

196
00:15:08,547 --> 00:15:10,599
So, I will forget about everything.

197
00:15:11,532 --> 00:15:14,246
Please pretend we are strangers.

198
00:15:15,284 --> 00:15:17,404
Pretend you don't know me, Jun Seo.

199
00:15:17,404 --> 00:15:18,502
Can you do that for me?

200
00:16:05,002 --> 00:16:07,581
Happy birthday, Eun Seo.

201
00:16:12,092 --> 00:16:13,867
- Happy birthday.
- Thank you.

202
00:16:13,867 --> 00:16:15,812
This is for you.

203
00:16:15,812 --> 00:16:17,269
Mom.

204
00:16:18,724 --> 00:16:20,754
I love it.

205
00:16:20,754 --> 00:16:22,572
Thank you, Mom.

206
00:16:23,414 --> 00:16:25,206
- Happy birthday.
- Thanks.

207
00:16:25,206 --> 00:16:26,377
Happy birthday.

208
00:16:26,377 --> 00:16:27,530
Thank you.

209
00:16:29,882 --> 00:16:32,650
You are going to be late. Hurry up.

210
00:16:32,650 --> 00:16:36,161
How many friends can I invite today?

211
00:16:36,161 --> 00:16:38,313
As many as you want.
You can invite the whole class.

212
00:16:38,313 --> 00:16:39,693
Are you sure?

213
00:16:39,693 --> 00:16:40,865
By the way...

214
00:16:42,283 --> 00:16:43,811
What about Eun Seo?

215
00:16:46,191 --> 00:16:49,155
It is also Eun Seo's birthday today.

216
00:16:52,409 --> 00:16:55,547
Yes, it is Eun Seo's birthday, too.

217
00:16:56,632 --> 00:17:00,260
She is probably busy today.

218
00:17:00,260 --> 00:17:01,791
Why would she be busy?

219
00:17:04,684 --> 00:17:06,158
Would she come?

220
00:17:07,926 --> 00:17:10,180
We have less than a week before we leave,

221
00:17:10,180 --> 00:17:12,285
so it would be better
to have dinner together.

222
00:17:12,285 --> 00:17:13,431
Is that okay with you?

223
00:17:15,668 --> 00:17:16,789
What do you think, Sin Ae?

224
00:17:19,524 --> 00:17:20,524
Yes.

225
00:17:22,549 --> 00:17:24,397
Eun Seo.

226
00:17:24,397 --> 00:17:26,831
How long are they going to
care about Eun Seo?

227
00:17:30,817 --> 00:17:31,817
What?

228
00:17:32,993 --> 00:17:35,114
This. Happy birthday.

229
00:17:35,722 --> 00:17:38,004
Thanks, Jun Seo.

230
00:17:40,491 --> 00:17:43,148
Thanks, it is a watch.

231
00:17:43,859 --> 00:17:46,110
Does it look good? Thanks.

232
00:17:47,211 --> 00:17:48,638
It is cute.

233
00:17:49,597 --> 00:17:51,291
It looks expensive.

234
00:17:52,600 --> 00:17:53,703
This.

235
00:17:54,843 --> 00:17:56,581
You don't even wear this.

236
00:17:56,581 --> 00:17:57,829
Can't I have it?

237
00:18:00,501 --> 00:18:04,069
I gave this to Eun Seo
for her birthday last year.

238
00:18:04,556 --> 00:18:06,319
So, you mean it belongs to Eun Seo?

239
00:18:07,717 --> 00:18:09,229
Is that why you gave me this?

240
00:18:09,229 --> 00:18:12,556
No. That watch is just your birthday gift.

241
00:18:12,556 --> 00:18:14,567
Eun Seo wants to have this one.

242
00:18:18,461 --> 00:18:19,703
Fine.

243
00:18:20,412 --> 00:18:22,219
I understand.

244
00:18:22,219 --> 00:18:24,963
It was Eun Seo's. So, give it back to her.

245
00:18:24,963 --> 00:18:27,913
But I'll be the one to give it to her.

246
00:18:27,913 --> 00:18:29,858
It is her birthday,
so this can be her birthday gift.

247
00:18:29,858 --> 00:18:32,902
I have been wanting to make up
with Eun Seo before I leave.

248
00:19:05,521 --> 00:19:07,832
Anyone who is available is welcome.

249
00:19:07,832 --> 00:19:09,970
Of course, we are coming.

250
00:19:09,970 --> 00:19:12,281
We are going to
have a party in our garden.

251
00:19:12,281 --> 00:19:15,186
Then can we meet your brother?

252
00:19:15,186 --> 00:19:19,147
Of course, you will.
It is his sister's birthday party.

253
00:19:19,147 --> 00:19:21,743
If you want to come, anyone is welcome!

254
00:19:21,743 --> 00:19:22,782
All right.

255
00:19:22,782 --> 00:19:25,658
If you don't want to come,
I guess that is fine, too.

256
00:19:26,135 --> 00:19:28,336
Are we going to have some food?

257
00:19:28,336 --> 00:19:29,958
Of course, what kind of food do you want?

258
00:19:33,331 --> 00:19:35,508
What I regret the most is that...

259
00:19:35,508 --> 00:19:40,300
I left behind the watch
you had given me...

260
00:19:40,300 --> 00:19:42,208
for my birthday last year, at home.

261
00:20:02,631 --> 00:20:05,392
I can't wait to go.

262
00:20:05,392 --> 00:20:06,515
I am really looking forward to it.

263
00:20:06,588 --> 00:20:10,392
The blue wind blows

264
00:20:10,392 --> 00:20:14,281
And creates a blue wave

265
00:20:14,281 --> 00:20:18,091
In this green range

266
00:20:18,091 --> 00:20:21,490
The bushes have grown a lot

267
00:20:21,490 --> 00:20:25,599
The melted snow made valleys and creeks

268
00:20:25,599 --> 00:20:29,250
Flowing down the land, and became a river

269
00:20:33,550 --> 00:20:35,654
It's fine. Stop crying, Sin Ae.

270
00:20:35,654 --> 00:20:37,808
Sin Ae, don't cry.

271
00:20:38,918 --> 00:20:40,232
What is wrong with her?

272
00:20:42,172 --> 00:20:44,086
Stop crying, Sin Ae. It is okay.

273
00:20:44,086 --> 00:20:46,628
What is wrong? It's all right. Don't cry.

274
00:20:46,628 --> 00:20:48,156
Don't cry.

275
00:20:55,274 --> 00:20:56,389
Can I have your attention?

276
00:20:57,761 --> 00:21:01,983
I am very disappointed right now.

277
00:21:01,983 --> 00:21:05,047
I can't believe such a thing happened
in my class.

278
00:21:05,047 --> 00:21:06,649
I am at a loss for words.

279
00:21:07,566 --> 00:21:11,482
Everyone, place your bag on your desk.

280
00:21:16,514 --> 00:21:20,292
And all of you,
get on your knees on the desk.

281
00:21:31,282 --> 00:21:35,485
Yoon Sin Ae lost her watch.

282
00:21:36,377 --> 00:21:38,750
Sin Ae, what does your watch look like?

283
00:21:39,474 --> 00:21:41,261
It is a Mickey Mouse watch.

284
00:21:43,946 --> 00:21:47,613
If anyone finds it...

285
00:21:49,875 --> 00:21:53,274
please, bring it back to me.

286
00:21:53,274 --> 00:21:54,827
It is so important to me.

287
00:21:56,450 --> 00:21:58,245
Now, close your eyes.

288
00:21:59,841 --> 00:22:02,512
Raise your hand if you have the watch.

289
00:22:02,512 --> 00:22:05,779
I will let this go
if you turn yourself in now.

290
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:09,747
Nobody?

291
00:22:11,839 --> 00:22:13,515
Okay, then you leave me with no choice.

292
00:22:41,576 --> 00:22:43,820
Eun Seo, let me see your bag.

293
00:22:46,439 --> 00:22:48,123
Eun Seo, what's wrong?

294
00:22:51,490 --> 00:22:52,490
Choi Eun Seo.

295
00:22:58,320 --> 00:22:59,404
Eun Seo.

296
00:23:00,625 --> 00:23:03,488
No, I didn't do it.

297
00:23:03,488 --> 00:23:05,118
I did not.

298
00:23:07,184 --> 00:23:08,235
I can't believe this.

299
00:23:10,128 --> 00:23:14,252
It is all right, teacher. I am fine.

300
00:23:14,252 --> 00:23:17,000
Actually, I brought it to give to her.

301
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:18,201
So, it is all right.

302
00:23:18,609 --> 00:23:20,393
No. I didn't.

303
00:23:20,393 --> 00:23:22,035
I didn't do it.

304
00:23:22,648 --> 00:23:25,696
It was under my desk. Jun Seo...

305
00:23:25,696 --> 00:23:28,506
Jun Seo? Did he give it to you?

306
00:23:29,481 --> 00:23:31,083
Did he?

307
00:23:34,450 --> 00:23:36,282
(Teachers' Lounge)

308
00:23:43,874 --> 00:23:46,516
Did Jun Seo give Eun Seo this watch?

309
00:23:49,489 --> 00:23:53,592
Jun Seo saw me this morning...

310
00:23:53,592 --> 00:23:55,804
putting the watch in my bag
to bring it to you.

311
00:23:57,017 --> 00:23:59,032
Who is telling the truth?

312
00:23:59,032 --> 00:24:01,658
Eun Seo,
you told me Jun Seo gave it to you.

313
00:24:05,224 --> 00:24:07,250
Did you lie?

314
00:24:12,433 --> 00:24:15,346
Yoon Jun Seo, tell the truth.

315
00:24:15,346 --> 00:24:17,283
Did you give it to Eun Seo?

316
00:24:18,050 --> 00:24:21,361
I...

317
00:24:21,361 --> 00:24:24,232
No, he did not give it to me.

318
00:24:24,232 --> 00:24:26,756
I have not even met him today.

319
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:32,369
Then, did you steal it?

320
00:24:33,657 --> 00:24:37,049
Teacher, it is all my fault.

321
00:24:37,049 --> 00:24:39,362
I should not have told you
I got it stolen.

322
00:24:40,296 --> 00:24:42,409
If I had known she took it,

323
00:24:42,409 --> 00:24:45,273
I would not tell you like that.

324
00:24:45,273 --> 00:24:47,131
It was hers from the beginning.

325
00:24:48,121 --> 00:24:49,795
It is my fault, teacher.

326
00:24:56,888 --> 00:24:59,259
(I am a liar.)

327
00:25:00,927 --> 00:25:02,380
Eun Seo, what have you done?

328
00:25:06,530 --> 00:25:07,585
What happened?

329
00:25:09,206 --> 00:25:11,648
Eun Seo, what have you done?

330
00:25:18,444 --> 00:25:20,057
Jun Seo.

331
00:25:21,294 --> 00:25:22,756
Jun Seo, go with me.

332
00:25:24,175 --> 00:25:25,518
Let's go together.

333
00:25:25,518 --> 00:25:27,991
Many of my friends are coming to meet you.

334
00:25:27,991 --> 00:25:30,261
Jun Seo, you should come home.
If you don't, you will regret it.

335
00:25:33,951 --> 00:25:36,599
It is my party! Come on!

336
00:25:36,599 --> 00:25:40,974
(I am a liar.)

337
00:25:40,974 --> 00:25:44,991
(I am ashamed of being a liar.)

338
00:25:44,991 --> 00:25:48,602
(I will not lie ever again.)

339
00:26:19,935 --> 00:26:20,976
Eun Seo.

340
00:26:23,311 --> 00:26:25,379
I said we should be strangers.

341
00:26:33,903 --> 00:26:35,024
Okay, then.

342
00:26:35,024 --> 00:26:37,033
Let's start from the beginning
as if we just met.

343
00:26:37,494 --> 00:26:40,567
Hi, I am Yoon Jun Seo.

344
00:26:40,567 --> 00:26:42,083
I hope we get along well.

345
00:26:42,672 --> 00:26:45,170
By the way, you are so pretty.

346
00:26:54,928 --> 00:26:58,459
I'm not a liar.

347
00:26:58,459 --> 00:27:00,891
I didn't lie.

348
00:27:00,891 --> 00:27:03,885
I didn't steal it. I swear.

349
00:27:07,034 --> 00:27:10,487
I know that.

350
00:27:12,396 --> 00:27:15,678
All right, if you do, I will be fine.

351
00:27:15,678 --> 00:27:16,872
That is all that matters to me.

352
00:27:21,286 --> 00:27:24,612
Let's go to the beach.

353
00:27:28,913 --> 00:27:29,916
Okay.

354
00:28:30,519 --> 00:28:31,650
I am done.

355
00:28:33,278 --> 00:28:35,174
Who is this?

356
00:28:35,174 --> 00:28:36,975
It's you.

357
00:28:36,975 --> 00:28:38,115
Is it really me?

358
00:28:39,191 --> 00:28:40,808
Am I this ugly?

359
00:28:43,061 --> 00:28:45,202
- You don't like it?
- No, I don't.

360
00:28:45,775 --> 00:28:47,719
Then, I will try something you would like.

361
00:28:47,719 --> 00:28:48,719
Let's go.

362
00:29:12,893 --> 00:29:14,688
I know you have been all alone.

363
00:29:15,599 --> 00:29:16,905
Take mine with you.

364
00:29:19,839 --> 00:29:22,234
You left with yours.

365
00:29:23,208 --> 00:29:25,250
Please put mine and yours together.

366
00:29:25,728 --> 00:29:27,049
Please do that.

367
00:29:48,407 --> 00:29:49,651
Isn't it late?

368
00:29:50,894 --> 00:29:54,178
We still have about half an hour
until the last bus.

369
00:29:56,087 --> 00:29:58,272
Did you make a call home?

370
00:30:01,455 --> 00:30:02,730
What do we do now?

371
00:30:04,992 --> 00:30:06,874
Shall we make confessions,
which you like doing?

372
00:30:10,023 --> 00:30:14,429
If there is anything
I did wrong to Eun Seo...

373
00:30:15,916 --> 00:30:17,764
No, there is none.

374
00:30:17,764 --> 00:30:20,634
Have I ever bullied you?

375
00:30:20,634 --> 00:30:23,773
I have never hated or tricked you.

376
00:30:30,642 --> 00:30:31,741
When are you leaving?

377
00:30:35,803 --> 00:30:38,837
When are you leaving for the U.S.?

378
00:30:43,217 --> 00:30:46,502
When are you coming back?

379
00:30:51,306 --> 00:30:53,221
It will take a long time, right?

380
00:30:56,843 --> 00:30:58,278
How long will it take?

381
00:31:02,274 --> 00:31:04,037
I wonder how long it will take.

382
00:31:05,371 --> 00:31:09,237
It'll probably take a long time, right?

383
00:31:10,106 --> 00:31:11,846
How long might that be?

384
00:31:14,089 --> 00:31:16,733
What if you forget about me?

385
00:31:17,659 --> 00:31:21,430
What should I do if you forget about me?

386
00:31:22,188 --> 00:31:23,854
What should I do, Jun Seo?

387
00:31:29,442 --> 00:31:30,649
Eun Seo.

388
00:31:34,959 --> 00:31:40,434
What do you want to be
if you were to be born again?

389
00:31:43,511 --> 00:31:44,601
A tree.

390
00:31:47,910 --> 00:31:50,979
I will remember that.

391
00:31:52,622 --> 00:31:56,425
Even if I forget everything,
I will remember that.

392
00:31:58,200 --> 00:31:59,322
A tree.

393
00:32:28,786 --> 00:32:30,672
- Kim Geum Sook.
- Yes.

394
00:32:30,672 --> 00:32:32,769
- Jung Hye Jin.
- Yes.

395
00:32:32,769 --> 00:32:34,256
Yoon Sin...

396
00:32:34,256 --> 00:32:39,314
Yoon Sin Ae transferred today.

397
00:32:39,314 --> 00:32:43,806
Sin Ae will study abroad in the U.S.

398
00:32:44,691 --> 00:32:50,868
So, we need to vote
for a new vice president.

399
00:32:50,868 --> 00:32:52,879
To replace Sin Ae...

400
00:32:54,350 --> 00:32:55,429
Eun Seo.

401
00:34:27,684 --> 00:34:30,641
Mom. Dad.

402
00:34:35,510 --> 00:34:36,849
Jun Seo.

403
00:34:38,343 --> 00:34:39,746
Jun Seo.

404
00:34:47,430 --> 00:34:53,205
In the field where autumn wind has passed

405
00:34:53,205 --> 00:34:58,955
Evening smoke rises up in thick clouds

406
00:34:58,955 --> 00:35:01,764
Changing into colored clothes

407
00:35:01,764 --> 00:35:02,917
Why did you stop?

408
00:35:03,955 --> 00:35:05,295
Did you forget the lyrics?

409
00:35:06,011 --> 00:35:08,173
Sing it again, come on.

410
00:35:09,972 --> 00:35:11,196
Come on.

411
00:35:12,572 --> 00:35:16,356
If you don't sing it now,
I won't see you again.

412
00:35:16,356 --> 00:35:19,980
I won't hang out with you.
I won't even call you "brother."

413
00:35:19,980 --> 00:35:21,301
So, sing it now.

414
00:35:25,188 --> 00:35:26,309
Excuse me.

415
00:35:27,121 --> 00:35:29,231
- Hello.
- Hello.

416
00:35:30,116 --> 00:35:31,899
Can I lend a bike for a while?

417
00:35:31,899 --> 00:35:33,053
Sure, just bring it as it is, please.

418
00:35:33,053 --> 00:35:34,723
Okay, I will be back in a couple of hours.

419
00:35:36,006 --> 00:35:37,129
Thank you.

420
00:37:12,665 --> 00:37:14,682
You are my sister.

421
00:37:14,682 --> 00:37:15,781
My sister.

422
00:37:27,990 --> 00:37:28,996
(Hometown Restaurant)

423
00:37:28,996 --> 00:37:30,357
Enjoy your meal.

424
00:37:30,357 --> 00:37:31,357
Thanks.

425
00:37:31,837 --> 00:37:35,020
You came here last year, right?

426
00:37:35,020 --> 00:37:36,124
Yes, I did.

427
00:37:36,124 --> 00:37:37,615
Did you find your sister?

428
00:37:39,605 --> 00:37:40,894
No.

429
00:37:40,894 --> 00:37:44,855
She has not come back here.

430
00:37:44,855 --> 00:37:47,062
Rumor has it that
they could not stay in Seoul,

431
00:37:47,062 --> 00:37:49,142
and moved to another place.

432
00:37:49,142 --> 00:37:51,923
Her brother was a bad man.

433
00:37:54,534 --> 00:37:56,113
Yes, I know that.

434
00:37:57,126 --> 00:37:59,368
I will spend the night here,
and be back tomorrow early.

435
00:37:59,847 --> 00:38:03,312
I thought you ran away
the day before your engagement party.

436
00:38:04,110 --> 00:38:07,552
Did you go to your hometown
to meet your first love?

437
00:38:09,310 --> 00:38:11,854
I can tell you that for sure.

438
00:38:11,854 --> 00:38:12,902
You are wrong.

439
00:38:14,911 --> 00:38:17,376
Have a good time.
I will be waiting for you.

440
00:38:18,515 --> 00:38:20,374
I will be waiting for you right here.

441
00:38:21,995 --> 00:38:23,286
Do you want me to take off more?

442
00:38:24,194 --> 00:38:26,164
Just take off one more thing.

443
00:38:26,164 --> 00:38:27,784
Then, how many are there?

444
00:38:27,784 --> 00:38:30,413
One, two.

445
00:38:30,413 --> 00:38:33,903
- Two.
- Two.

446
00:38:33,903 --> 00:38:35,583
Be quiet. Let me hear more.

447
00:38:37,674 --> 00:38:38,987
What is it?

448
00:38:38,987 --> 00:38:41,154
What did you do?

449
00:38:41,154 --> 00:38:42,571
No. I need to hear more of it.

450
00:38:42,571 --> 00:38:44,403
You said we are allowed to eavesdrop.

451
00:38:48,240 --> 00:38:49,935
This is a telephone operator.

452
00:38:49,935 --> 00:38:52,730
Ms. Choi, were you listening to all of it?

453
00:38:55,831 --> 00:38:58,127
Who listened to what?

454
00:38:58,127 --> 00:39:01,456
I said you could eavesdrop
when I am talking to a woman.

455
00:39:01,456 --> 00:39:03,228
Was the talk too explicit?

456
00:39:03,228 --> 00:39:04,451
I am going out to play golf.

457
00:39:04,451 --> 00:39:06,923
I will put my laundry outside,
so please take care of that.

458
00:39:06,923 --> 00:39:08,070
Please.

459
00:39:08,581 --> 00:39:11,142
Can we have lunch tomorrow?

460
00:39:13,068 --> 00:39:15,282
I'm just thankful.

461
00:39:17,063 --> 00:39:19,650
I am not flirting with
a 37-year-old married woman.

462
00:39:20,943 --> 00:39:22,082
No?

463
00:39:23,593 --> 00:39:26,386
Are you that ugly?

464
00:39:28,991 --> 00:39:30,256
Who is it?

465
00:39:30,256 --> 00:39:31,317
His name is Tae Seok.

466
00:39:31,317 --> 00:39:34,445
He is a professional golfer
staying in the villa for a long term.

467
00:39:34,445 --> 00:39:36,919
How did you become
a 37-year-old married woman?

468
00:39:36,919 --> 00:39:38,324
I am going home now.

469
00:40:06,850 --> 00:40:10,415
Will you keep staying away from your job
even when you come here?

470
00:40:11,389 --> 00:40:13,334
Just fire me, then.

471
00:40:13,956 --> 00:40:16,832
That is not up to me.

472
00:40:17,789 --> 00:40:20,744
You're Father's youngest and favorite son.

473
00:40:27,973 --> 00:40:29,494
I think it is expensive.

474
00:40:31,733 --> 00:40:33,970
Can you fire me for property damage?

475
00:41:05,769 --> 00:41:10,723
Why is the ventilation system
not working in this room?

476
00:41:11,185 --> 00:41:13,105
I am sorry, sir.

477
00:41:13,105 --> 00:41:15,548
I will put you through
to the housekeeping department.

478
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:19,299
Hello.

479
00:41:25,314 --> 00:41:28,690
Did you say the ventilation system
is not working?

480
00:41:28,690 --> 00:41:32,635
I will let you know
how to operate it manually.

481
00:41:32,635 --> 00:41:34,642
First, go to the bathroom.

482
00:41:34,642 --> 00:41:39,859
Take the showerhead with your left hand,
and raise it over your head.

483
00:41:39,859 --> 00:41:41,811
Can you see the button below?

484
00:41:41,811 --> 00:41:42,965
Press the button.

485
00:41:43,979 --> 00:41:45,048
It is cold.

486
00:41:46,547 --> 00:41:47,657
Hey.

487
00:41:47,657 --> 00:41:49,185
Why are you being rude?

488
00:41:49,185 --> 00:41:52,097
I can tell you are younger.
How old are you?

489
00:41:52,097 --> 00:41:55,619
I am 37 years old with two children.

490
00:43:07,604 --> 00:43:11,271
Do you want to get hit?

491
00:43:12,044 --> 00:43:13,063
Get out of the way.

492
00:43:15,938 --> 00:43:17,142
You, there.

493
00:43:19,396 --> 00:43:23,196
Get out of my way.

494
00:43:23,196 --> 00:43:24,197
Hey.

495
00:43:29,782 --> 00:43:30,826
Yoon Jun Seo.

496
00:43:30,826 --> 00:43:33,611
Han Tae Seok. How have you been?

497
00:43:33,611 --> 00:43:35,596
What made you come here?

498
00:43:35,596 --> 00:43:36,783
I came to see you.

499
00:43:40,981 --> 00:43:43,147
I guess you are being really patient.

500
00:43:43,147 --> 00:43:45,892
I have to be. At least my father likes me.

501
00:43:45,892 --> 00:43:48,964
It is fine except for my brothers visiting
to bother me from time to time.

502
00:43:48,964 --> 00:43:50,593
No employees know about me.

503
00:43:50,593 --> 00:43:53,617
It would be annoying if they knew
the CEO's son came here to get training.

504
00:43:53,617 --> 00:43:56,391
Are you getting training?
I heard all you do is play golf.

505
00:43:56,391 --> 00:43:58,184
That is my job.

506
00:43:58,184 --> 00:43:59,640
Do you want to see my certificate?

507
00:43:59,640 --> 00:44:00,930
I don't need to.

508
00:44:01,565 --> 00:44:04,369
- Is this where you are staying?
- Yes, come on in.

509
00:44:08,343 --> 00:44:10,351
Are you not working on art anymore?

510
00:44:10,351 --> 00:44:12,341
He said I can do anything but art.

511
00:44:15,031 --> 00:44:16,703
- Would you like a beer?
- Sure.

512
00:44:16,703 --> 00:44:17,706
All right.

513
00:44:18,263 --> 00:44:21,078
Aren't you getting bored
staying in a place like this alone?

514
00:44:21,078 --> 00:44:22,887
I have Ms. Choi.

515
00:44:23,556 --> 00:44:24,909
Who is Ms. Choi?

516
00:44:26,059 --> 00:44:30,242
She is a very strict telephone operator.

517
00:44:30,242 --> 00:44:32,299
I got along with her here.

518
00:44:32,299 --> 00:44:34,099
You made me anxious.

519
00:44:34,099 --> 00:44:36,514
I thought you were cheating on Sin Ae.

520
00:44:36,514 --> 00:44:38,868
What do you think of me?

521
00:44:39,514 --> 00:44:42,154
- How is Yu Mi?
- She is doing well.

522
00:44:42,154 --> 00:44:46,661
Those were good times studying art
with you and Yu Mi.

523
00:44:47,931 --> 00:44:50,793
When Sin Ae finishes school,

524
00:44:50,793 --> 00:44:53,498
we will move to our hometown nearby.

525
00:44:53,498 --> 00:44:54,748
Is Sin Ae coming, too?

526
00:44:56,401 --> 00:44:57,682
I am not sure.

527
00:44:57,682 --> 00:45:00,107
I will talk about it with dad and mom
tomorrow when I get back.

528
00:45:00,667 --> 00:45:04,186
Are they here? I thought
they were coming back with Sin Ae.

529
00:45:04,186 --> 00:45:05,792
Is there something wrong?

530
00:45:05,792 --> 00:45:06,867
No.

531
00:45:10,920 --> 00:45:12,299
I am getting engaged tomorrow.

532
00:45:14,953 --> 00:45:17,242
What? You're finally getting engaged
to Shin Yu Mi?

533
00:45:18,593 --> 00:45:20,680
Dude.

534
00:45:20,680 --> 00:45:22,433
That is really nice.

535
00:45:22,433 --> 00:45:23,945
Congratulations. Cheers.

536
00:45:23,945 --> 00:45:25,035
Thanks.

537
00:46:03,608 --> 00:46:06,491
What beautiful stars.

538
00:46:12,010 --> 00:46:14,635
Fess up. What is it?

539
00:46:18,888 --> 00:46:20,192
I wonder...

540
00:46:20,192 --> 00:46:22,828
what made you come all the way here
when you are about to get engaged.

541
00:46:25,714 --> 00:46:27,319
I have a secret girl.

542
00:46:27,763 --> 00:46:28,869
A secret girl?

543
00:46:30,858 --> 00:46:32,677
My family has a secret girl.

544
00:46:34,979 --> 00:46:37,081
Just like my family.

545
00:46:37,081 --> 00:46:39,701
My family has me, a secret son.

546
00:46:42,730 --> 00:46:43,749
Who is she?

547
00:46:46,697 --> 00:46:49,507
I came here to tell her I am engaged.

548
00:46:49,507 --> 00:46:51,855
Did you tell her? What did she say?

549
00:46:52,668 --> 00:46:53,854
Did I tell her?

550
00:46:55,908 --> 00:46:57,094
I will, soon.

551
00:46:58,987 --> 00:47:00,384
I will tell her.

552
00:47:12,069 --> 00:47:16,463
I am getting engaged.

553
00:47:28,122 --> 00:47:29,987
What about doing it this way?

554
00:47:29,987 --> 00:47:33,702
You have your engagement party,
and I get to enjoy the first night.

555
00:47:33,702 --> 00:47:34,703
What do you say? Isn't that a good idea?

556
00:47:34,703 --> 00:47:36,990
Stop talking nonsense and just drive.

557
00:48:09,609 --> 00:48:11,356
Jun Seo, do you remember?

558
00:48:13,946 --> 00:48:16,569
When you first met me,

559
00:48:16,569 --> 00:48:19,036
what was the first thing you asked me?

560
00:48:22,538 --> 00:48:25,500
You asked what I wanted to be
if I were to be born again?

561
00:48:28,674 --> 00:48:29,724
I remember that.

562
00:48:30,886 --> 00:48:32,779
Do you also remember what I said?

563
00:48:35,326 --> 00:48:36,326
Tree.

564
00:48:42,653 --> 00:48:48,040
I'm taking root in you now, Jun Seo.

565
00:49:23,672 --> 00:49:25,555
(Telephone Operators)

566
00:49:27,673 --> 00:49:29,096
Yes, sir, yes.

567
00:49:29,096 --> 00:49:32,054
- I will be back.
- Thank you.

568
00:49:33,195 --> 00:49:34,439
Yes, this is the operator.

569
00:49:36,332 --> 00:49:37,859
Excuse me.

570
00:49:37,859 --> 00:49:38,883
Yes?

571
00:49:40,289 --> 00:49:42,541
Is there a married woman here?

572
00:49:42,541 --> 00:49:44,164
Here?

573
00:49:44,164 --> 00:49:46,014
We are all in our early 20s.

574
00:50:42,510 --> 00:50:43,937
Ms. Choi, please.

575
00:50:44,820 --> 00:50:47,033
Hello, it's me.

576
00:51:10,896 --> 00:51:12,935
I have something to tell you.

577
00:51:12,935 --> 00:51:14,162
I do have something to tell you.

578
00:51:22,579 --> 00:51:24,731
Hold on.

579
00:51:24,731 --> 00:51:25,965
Just hear me out.

580
00:51:26,781 --> 00:51:30,750
Did you meet your first love
in your hometown yesterday?

581
00:51:35,692 --> 00:51:36,694
Hello?

582
00:51:40,228 --> 00:51:41,503
Ms. Choi.

583
00:51:47,579 --> 00:51:49,750
What was your first love like?

584
00:51:52,803 --> 00:51:54,189
What is your real name?

585
00:51:54,611 --> 00:51:56,214
What is the name of your first love?

586
00:51:58,187 --> 00:51:59,270
Tree.

587
00:52:00,219 --> 00:52:02,726
Eun Seo. Choi Eun Seo.

588
00:52:07,618 --> 00:52:10,356
Take responsibility? How do I do that?

589
00:52:12,040 --> 00:52:14,081
You can't get close to my room attendant.

590
00:52:14,081 --> 00:52:15,167
Is it a woman?

591
00:52:15,167 --> 00:52:16,656
How much are you worth?

592
00:52:16,656 --> 00:52:17,667
I will buy you.

593
00:52:17,667 --> 00:52:19,259
I will pay you more.

594
00:52:20,257 --> 00:52:21,784
This beach...

595
00:52:21,784 --> 00:52:24,857
This place is more than anything for me
with precious memories.

596
00:52:24,857 --> 00:52:26,315
Will you be my girlfriend?

597
00:52:30,231 --> 00:52:32,924
The number is 0215.
It is the same number as mine.

598
00:52:34,157 --> 00:52:36,090
Whose birthday is it?

599
00:52:36,951 --> 00:52:38,300
I meant your pager number.

600
00:52:39,295 --> 00:52:40,897
It is my brother's birthday.

601
00:52:43,406 --> 00:52:47,152
You must have returned without meeting
the person you were looking for.

602
00:52:47,152 --> 00:52:49,360
I think I have been mistaken.

603
00:52:52,892 --> 00:52:54,392
Because I missed her so much.
